      "note": "Inside the for-loop (line 92) iterating ancount answer RRs, each RR with rr_class==C_IN, rr_type==T_A, rr_len==sizeof(struct in_addr), and rr_name matching the question hostname creates and appends a new ares_addrinfo_node to the nodes list. The PoC encodes at least 6 such matching A records. After the loop, nodes are assigned to ai->nodes at line 234.",
